OL,3,GNEWSASerious A34 crash causes
OL,4,Adisruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists have been warned to avoid a
OL,7,Fmajor road after a serious collision
OL,8,Fearlier.
OL,10,FThe A34 was closed in both directions
OL,11,Fnear Chieveley Services, near Newbury,
OL,12,Fat about 11:00 BST after the crash on
OL,13,Fthe northbound carriageway.
OL,15,FThe southbound carriageway reopened at
OL,16,Fabout 13:30 and Thames Valley Police
OL,17,Fsaid it was working to partially open
OL,18,Fthe northbound carriageway to relieve
OL,19,Ftraffic.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
